{
  "_about": "Canonical fan-out work-lists for the collector agents (1-6). Each agent's SKILL.md reads its slice and calls research-harness.workflow.js with it. ONE source of truth for 'what entities does each agent fan out over'. Edit here to add/remove a bank, portal, competitor, etc. The harness renders the table deterministically from the verified signals, so adding a unit here can never be silently dropped — if it returns nothing it shows as ⚠ EMPTY with a coverage warning. unitNoun/tableKind/findingsDir are passed straight through to the harness.",
  "_shared": {
    "productContext": "Printec sells: NCR ATMs (dispense / intelligent-deposit / recycling) + x-core multivendor ATM software, ATM/device telemetry & monitoring, self-service & bank kiosks, cash automation/recyclers (Glory / Sesami TCRs, NCR), NCR APTRA OptiCash cash optimisation, POS terminals & acquiring (Verifone / Castles) + terminal management (TMS), digital onboarding/eKYC (Namirial), AML/KYC (IMTF Siron, FICO), transaction monitoring (INETCO), Thales HSM/PCI, physical ATM security, and managed/field services. Key partner: NCR Atleos. Known footprint reference customers: Alpha Bank (Siron AML), BCR (APTRA), Erste Croatia (OptiCash), Raiffeisen Serbia (x-core), Bank of Cyprus (Glory TCR), PrivatBank & AikBank (NCR recyclers), OTP/Raiffeisen Albania."
  },
